{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876150/extras/8bc600ef44470562f17ebf57ba2b3b1e.poster.avif?t=1551633159\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876150/extras/8bc600ef44470562f17ebf57ba2b3b1e.webm?t=1551633159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876150/extras/8bc600ef44470562f17ebf57ba2b3b1e.mp4?t=1551633159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > A traveller in search of something lost </h2>Sisu is a forgiving yet challenging physics driven platformer.<br><br><br>In this playful adventure you find yourself searching planets in pursuit of energy cubes that power your spaceship but also evolve your abilities. Use these new-found powers to traverse obstacles and overcome grumpy alien species.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Friendly and forgiving yet challenging gameplay -&gt; Less frustration and more fun.<br></li><li> Featuring 40 levels and 3 boss battles.<br></li><li> Nonlinear gameplay -&gt; Beat 10 out of 20 levels on each planet to proceed.<br></li><li> A mix and match of 4 unique abilities.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/876150?t=1551633159","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1551633159","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1551633159","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1551633159","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descript